  "offensiveAbilities": [
    {
      "name": "Expert Sharpshooter",
      "actions": null,
      "traits": [],
      "description": "<p>The jygyk doubles the range increment of weapons in the sniper weapon group they wield. If they're ever unarmed or out of ammunition, they can Interact to create an tactical weapon in the sniper weapon group or 30 projectiles.</p>",
      "collapsed": false
    },
    {
      "name": "Fade To Nothing",
      "actions": 2,
      "traits": [
        "concentrate",
        "illusion"
      ],
      "description": "<p>The jygyk melts into their surroundings and becomes undetected, not even emitting sound or odor. A creature must succeed at a DC 25 Perception  check to Seek the jygyk. If the jygyk uses a hostile action, moves, or speaks, they become detected again after the action is completed.</p>",
      "collapsed": false
    },
    {
      "name": "Focus Aim",
      "actions": 1,
      "traits": [],
      "description": "<p>The jygyk takes careful aim at a target. If the jygyk’s next action is to make a ranged Strike with a weapon in the sniper weapon group, that Strike deals an additional weapon die of damage.</p>",
      "collapsed": false
    },
    {
      "name": "Reposition",
      "actions": 0,
      "traits": [
        "teleportation"
      ],
      "description": "<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per round</p>\n<p><strong>Trigger</strong> The jygyk's last action was a ranged Strike</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> The jygyk teleports to any location they can see within 25 feet.</p>",
      "collapsed": false
    }
